# Copy to .dev.vars for local dev. In production: `wrangler secret put GITHUB_TOKEN`.
# Optional. A fine-grained token with no extra permissions is enough to read a public gist.
# With it, the site reads the gist via the GitHub API (always current) instead of the raw URL
# (no token needed, but GitHub's CDN can lag up to ~5 minutes behind an edit).
GITHUB_TOKEN=
